      "id": "spatial.custom-height-can-change",
      "domain": "spatial-containment",
      "subject": "dimension bounds",
      "statement": "Bedrock worlds can define modified vertical dimension bounds and void generation, so authored assumptions about buildable height can become invalid when custom dimension bounds are used.",
